      *================================================================*
      * PROGRAM  : UTECRCAL                                            *
      * TYPE     : UNIT TEST DRIVER                                    *
      * PURPOSE  : UNIT TESTS FOR ECRCALC - EARNINGS CREDIT RATE TIERS *
      *            RESERVE DEDUCTION, CAPS AND EXCLUSIONS              *
      *================================================================*
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UTECRCAL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TESTPARM.
       COPY ECRPARM.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'INIT' TO TST-FUNCTION
           MOVE 'ECRCALC' TO TST-SUITE-NAME
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS

           PERFORM 1000-TEST-TIERS
           PERFORM 2000-TEST-CREDIT
           PERFORM 3000-TEST-EXCEPTIONS

           MOVE 'SUMM' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           STOP RUN.

       1000-TEST-TIERS.
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 18500000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'OVER $10MM TIER 3 = BASE 2.50 + 0.50' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 3.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-RATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 5000000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE '$5MM TIER 2 = BASE + 0.25' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 2.75 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-RATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 1000000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'EXACTLY $1,000,000 IS TIER 2' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '2' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ECR-TIER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 10000000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'EXACTLY $10,000,000 IS STILL TIER 2' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE '2' TO TST-EXPECTED
           MOVE ECR-TIER-CODE TO TST-ACTUAL
           PERFORM 9100-AEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 999999.99 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'UNDER $1MM EARNS BASE RATE 2.50' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 2.50 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-RATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       2000-TEST-CREDIT.
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 18500000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'INVESTABLE = AVG COLLECTED LESS 10% RESERVE'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 16650000 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-INVESTABLE-BAL TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'CREDIT 16.65MM x 3.00% x 30/365' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 41054.79 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-EARNINGS-CREDIT TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'DAY BASIS IS 365' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 365 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-DAY-BASIS TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 5000000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'CREDIT 4.5MM x 2.75% x 30/365' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 10171.23 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-EARNINGS-CREDIT TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       3000-TEST-EXCEPTIONS.
      *    FED FUNDS CAP
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 4.20     TO ECR-BASE-RATE
           MOVE 15000000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'ECR 4.70 CAPPED AT FED FUNDS 4.33' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 4.33 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-RATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'CAPPED CREDIT 13.5MM x 4.33% x 30/365'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 48045.21 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-EARNINGS-CREDIT TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

      *    BASE RATE NOT SET - DEFAULT 2.50
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE ZERO   TO ECR-BASE-RATE
           MOVE 500000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'BASE RATE ZERO DEFAULTS TO 2.50' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 2.50 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-RATE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

      *    MSB - NO CREDIT
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE 2800000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           MOVE 'Y'     TO ECR-MSB-FLAG
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'MSB CUSTOMER EARNS NO CREDIT' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE ZERO TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-EARNINGS-CREDIT TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

      *    NEGATIVE AVERAGE BALANCE
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE -420000 TO ECR-AVG-COLLECTED-BAL
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'NEGATIVE COLLECTED BALANCE - ZERO CREDIT RC 04'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'N' TO TST-CONDITION
           IF ECR-EARNINGS-CREDIT = 0 AND ECR-RETURN-CODE = 04
               MOVE 'Y' TO TST-CONDITION
           END-IF
           PERFORM 9200-TRUE

      *    INVALID DAYS
           PERFORM 8000-RESET
           MOVE ZERO TO ECR-DAYS-IN-PERIOD
           CALL 'ECRCALC' USING ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'ZERO DAYS IN PERIOD RC 12' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 12 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ECR-RETURN-CODE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       8000-RESET.
           INITIALIZE ECR-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 2.50 TO ECR-BASE-RATE
           MOVE 4.33 TO ECR-FED-FUNDS-RATE
           MOVE 30   TO ECR-DAYS-IN-PERIOD
           MOVE 'N'  TO ECR-MSB-FLAG.

       9000-NEQ.
           MOVE 'NEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.

       9100-AEQ.
           MOVE 'AEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.

       9200-TRUE.
           MOVE 'TRUE' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.
